 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "open",
   "text": "The oceans are sliding toward the equator.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 3.41,
   "sha256": "e6f984b6e22bbfe5c6a55aad8c0792bb218a11b460afdf69238d7140a951ef16"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "oceans-1",
   "text": "And then the oceans begin to move.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 1.58,
   "sha256": "2e3cc22f3147784ab12b91207dd1c470066fb8f26b56e8d153c23daa864dccb7"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "oceans-2",
   "text": "A spinning planet pushes water outward, toward the equator, exactly as it pushes you.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 5.37,
   "sha256": "46f8381d7dfb9bf21bbf17b3ea61e313805055cd702c925bb6927a6f8f8945e1"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "oceans-3",
   "text": "Today the Earth already bulges about twenty-one kilometers wider at the equator than from pole to pole, and the ground has had billions of years to settle into that shape.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 7.59,
   "sha256": "c27451ef16202657fdb09a89c49f25d553ffec7c1f40fe3aa80afaf66528dcc3"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "oceans-4",
   "text": "Speed the spin up quickly and the ground cannot adjust in time.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 2.5,
   "sha256": "928fe4ad42f4daea187328b3835d012929d7ff6de9ff6dab3539240a06b23535"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "oceans-5",
   "text": "At a twelve hour day, the water wants to stand about thirty-three kilometers higher at the equator than at the poles, extra, compared with today.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 5.41,
   "sha256": "2bee744588df44a148a32645e4aa0a41040b1247e0755ef3a134f49f7d5db4c5"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "oceans-6",
   "text": "The whole ocean is only about three point seven kilometers deep.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 3.84,
   "sha256": "8f3f10f3a2e98e9b0532083879b22dd741fab9df0234ea9aafeb162cf7db35f9"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "oceans-7",
   "text": "So the water does not simply rise.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 1.77,
   "sha256": "1d7d3286e5cc2095246c7cfb0ca74700015ba2c92ab785d9c30860a5635564b8"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "oceans-8",
   "text": "It drains toward a belt around the equator, while the poles dry out.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 3.03,
   "sha256": "07929223674e5d7dea84dc31c8af43aba8257c38ae0b33000763945ec4051c09"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "oceans-9",
   "text": "This is a rough, first guess, but the direction is certain: land near the poles emerges, and your own coast is flooded.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "10.wav",
   "dur": 5.92,
   "sha256": "61997627ba80260add5140796abe34c567301b3221cf8905c41b8ad24c11f3e8"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo11",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "Quick break: like and follow. Then let's see how bad this gets.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "11.wav",
   "dur": 3.04,
   "sha256": "94c58b0dbe3cb24374aa07321610b6ea7629ddb6f847a758e0a8807f659cf765"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo12",
   "beat": "cliff",
   "text": "And the weather is about to change completely.",
   "stars": [],
